# client-custom-fields.session-hardwired-id.must-fail.patch
#
# Targets: AC-2 retarget (the identity seam) — the collection reads the client
# named by the .for('client', id) scope context, never a hardwired session id.
# The id rides in a .for() context through resolveClientId(scopeContext?),
# never in .withId() (ADR-001).
#
# Authored by: developer seat (agent-seat-separation.companion.md — the seat
# that knows the exact line it changed authors the mutant; the prover applies
# it blind, confirms RED, then reverts — never reading src to construct it).
#
# Mutates: client-custom-fields.services.ts resolveClientId — drops the
